    "name": "os-lab-backport",
    "description": "Reviews a completed os-lab-loop run in a lab repo and backports approved changes to the master plugin sources: classifies each changed file as ACCEPT, ADAPT, REJECT or REVIEW, applies the approved diffs, and records learnings. Trigger with \"backport the lab results\", \"review the lab run\", \"apply lab improvements to master\", \"check what the lab agent changed\". DO NOT USE to build the lab (use os-lab-setup), to run the loop (use os-lab-loop), to score a single change (use os-lab-scorer), or to log and chart runs (use os-lab-log).\n",
